%% Figure: AI moderation request protection and aggregation sequence.
%% Render to: Images/Chapter 4/ai-request-protection.png
sequenceDiagram
    participant Relayer
    participant Aggregator as Moderation aggregator
    participant Nonces as SQLite nonce store
    participant Classifiers as Safety, spam, and civic classifiers

    Relayer->>Relayer: Build canonical request and sign it
    Relayer->>Aggregator: Send request with API key, signature, timestamp, and nonce
    Aggregator->>Aggregator: Recover signer and compare to trusted relayer address
    Aggregator->>Aggregator: Check timestamp within configured maximum age
    Aggregator->>Nonces: Check and record nonce
    Nonces-->>Aggregator: Reject if the nonce was already used
    Aggregator->>Classifiers: Forward content for classification
    Classifiers-->>Aggregator: Return accept or reject with confidence
    Aggregator->>Aggregator: Apply fail-closed aggregation rule
    Aggregator-->>Relayer: Return decision, hashes, and optional signature
